      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 504,
        "height": 472,
        "content": "## 🛒 Shopify Order Responder\n\nWhen a new Shopify order comes in, AI sends a warm, personalized confirmation with ONE genuinely relevant product suggestion — and logs the order with the upsell for tracking.\n\n**Flow:** New order → Normalize → AI confirmation → Shape → log + email.\n\n### Setup\n1. Connect **Shopify**, **Anthropic**, and **Gmail** credentials.\n2. Activate — Shopify registers the webhook automatically.\n3. Place a test order to see it run."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
